## 📐 Sistema de Diseño

### Paleta de Colores (Proyecto Libertad):

```dart
// core/theme/app_colors.dart
class AppColors {
  // Brand Colors
  static const primary = Color(0xFF1E3A8A);      // Azul profundo
  static const secondary = Color(0xFF7C3AED);    // Violeta
  static const accent = Color(0xFFFB923C);       // Coral
  
  // Functional Colors
  static const success = Color(0xFF10B981);      // Verde
  static const warning = Color(0xFFF59E0B);      // Ámbar
  static const error = Color(0xFFEF4444);        // Rojo
  static const info = Color(0xFF3B82F6);         // Azul cielo
  
  // Surfaces
  static const background = Color(0xFFF8FAFC);   // Gris muy claro
  static const surface = Color(0xFFFFFFFF);      // Blanco
  static const surfaceVariant = Color(0xFFF1F5F9);
  
  // Text
  static const textPrimary = Color(0xFF0F172A);  // Casi negro
  static const textSecondary = Color(0xFF64748B); // Gris
  static const textTertiary = Color(0xFF94A3B8);
  
  // Borders
  static const border = Color(0xFFE2E8F0);
  static const borderLight = Color(0xFFF1F5F9);
}
```

### Tipografía:
- **Fuente**: Inter (Google Fonts)
- **Pesos**: 400 (Regular), 500 (Medium), 600 (SemiBold), 700 (Bold)

### Espaciado:
- **Base unit**: 4px
- **Scale**: 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64

